# Ajani Unrelenting: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability, create a 2/2 colorless Wizard Soldier creature token named Cadet."
# "+1: Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn." Casting him makes no Cadet (no ability was activated;
# the battlefield count is checked before the +1). The +1 on turn 3 triggers the Cadet, which is on the battlefield before the +1
# resolves (the ruling), so it is a 3/2 with haste, as is Bot1's Ornithopter; Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature of another controller,
# is untouched (CR 611.2c, 608.2). The effect ends with the turn: on turn 5 the Cadet is a 2/2 without haste again.

